[SPEAKER_04]: Even without the right view, even without the Buddha's teaching.

114
00:06:28,645 --> 00:06:29,545
[SPEAKER_04]: But not without the work.

115
00:06:33,619 --> 00:06:38,862
[SPEAKER_04]: Because there's a difference between abandoning sensuality and replacing it with a higher reward.

116
00:06:39,502 --> 00:06:40,382
