124
00:07:05,554 --> 00:07:26,331
[SPEAKER_04]: Like, if monks and nuns, or practices, other practices, samanas, ibrāmins of other religions, freed themselves from sensuality, it had to have been the same way of gradual training, unintentionally, withdrawal, guarding of the sense door, living in the seclusion, and really experiencing that self-loathing on the level of the presence of the body and the aggregates, that they do not want.

125
00:07:27,072 --> 00:07:31,056
[SPEAKER_04]: But not act out of it, to destroy it, or go back to sensuality.

126
