604
00:40:15,502 --> 00:40:19,064
[SPEAKER_04]: But that's already fully based on yonisumnasikāra.

605
00:40:19,104 --> 00:40:20,064
[SPEAKER_04]: That's what that balance is.

606
00:40:20,884 --> 00:40:22,025
[SPEAKER_03]: And that's what yonisumnasikāra is.

