627
00:41:28,781 --> 00:41:30,462
[SPEAKER_04]: And I don't mean anything mystical by that.

628
00:41:30,502 --> 00:41:38,745
[SPEAKER_04]: I simply mean, like, seeing what else is simultaneously there, present as a background, as the root, as the womb of this attention, whatever I'm attending to.

629
00:41:39,225 --> 00:41:42,007
