630
00:41:42,027 --> 00:41:44,448
[SPEAKER_04]: They won't have any recognition of what the middle way is.

631
00:41:45,228 --> 00:41:50,432
[SPEAKER_04]: No, for that new book that I'm working on, I started translating yoniso manasikāra as, how do you say?

