00:41:50,612 --> 00:41:51,673
[SPEAKER_04]: Concurrent.

633
00:41:51,713 --> 00:41:52,253
[SPEAKER_04]: Concurrent.

634
00:41:52,893 --> 00:41:55,996
[SPEAKER_04]: Attending concurrently, or concurrent attention.

635
00:41:56,016 --> 00:41:57,537
[SPEAKER_04]: Simultaneous.

636
00:41:57,897 --> 00:41:58,357
[SPEAKER_04]: Concurrent.

637
00:41:58,517 --> 00:41:59,979
[SPEAKER_04]: So, yeah, I'm attending to this.

638
00:42:00,939 --> 00:42:11,307
