00:43:16,507 --> 00:43:17,568
[SPEAKER_04]: Not his problem anymore.

653
00:43:18,609 --> 00:43:35,864
[SPEAKER_04]: Aversion, the the weight of the repulsive, the weight of unenergetic, the weight of agitated, the weight of uncertainty, does not necessarily need to become a hindrance of a doubt, if you don't lose the sight of its counterweight, basically, the other end of it.

